<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35521" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">per-signo</span></b> , āre, v.
		a. (extremely rare; not in Cic. or Cæs.). <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>To note down</i>, <i>record</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">uni dona,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					25, 7, 5</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>To mark</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">notis corpus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mel.
					1, 19, 20</span></i>
			; so Firm. Math. 3, 7, 12.</div>
